@startuml NotePi Game Flow

title NotePi: Spil-flow fra start til game over

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 20

actor "Performer\n(bin/client)" as P
participant "Mikrofon\n+ aubio\n(NoteReader)" as MIC
participant "GameRoom\n(bin/game_room)" as GR
participant "NotePiGame" as NP
actor "Communicator\n(bin/client)" as C

== Spilstart ==
note over GR: Opretter NotePiGame\nVaelger 5 tilfaeldige noter\nfx [C, G, A, F#, D]
note over P: Ser 5 tomme felter\n(graa celler)
note over C: Ser 5 tomme felter\n+ Wordle-farver naar gaet kommer

== Runde 1: Performer spiller noter ==
note over P: Holder telefon op\ntil mikrofon og\nspiller en tone

MIC -> MIC: Audio frame (512 samples)\n1. RMS check (> 0.008?)\n2. aubio pitch detection (YIN)\n3. Confidence check (> 0.6?)\n4. Frekvens -> notenavn\n5. Sustain check (350ms)\n6. Cooldown (500ms)

MIC --> P: NoteEvent {note: "C", confidence: 0.85}
note over P: Celle 1 viser "C"\nSpiller naeste tone...

note over P: Har nu 5 noter: [C, E, A, F#, B]\nTrykker SUBMIT

P -> GR: **note_submit**\n{notes: ["C","E","A","F#","B"]}

GR -> NP: submitGuess(["C","E","A","F#","B"])
note over NP: Sammenligner med maal [C, G, A, F#, D]:\nC=C -> **groen**\nE!=G, E ikke i maal -> **roed**\nA=A -> **groen**\nF#=F# -> **groen**\nB!=D, B ikke i maal -> **roed**

NP --> GR: {colors: [groen, roed, groen, groen, roed],\ncorrect: false}

GR --> P: **note_state**\n{attempt: 1, notes: [...],\ncolors: [...], correct: false,\nhistory: [{...}]}
GR --> C: **note_state**\n(same)

note over P: Ser noter i graa\n(performer ser IKKE farver)
note over C: Ser noter med farver:\n[GROEN] C  [ROED] E  [GROEN] A  [GROEN] F#  [ROED] B\nGuider performer: "1, 3 og 4 er rigtige!\n2 og 5 er forkerte"

== Runde 2: Performer proever igen ==
note over P: Spiller nye toner baseret\npa communicators feedback
P -> GR: **note_submit**\n{notes: ["C","G","A","F#","D"]}

GR -> NP: submitGuess(["C","G","A","F#","D"])
note over NP: Alle 5 matcher!\ncorrect: true

NP --> GR: {colors: [groen x5], correct: true}

GR --> P: **note_state** (alle groenne)
GR --> C: **note_state** (alle groenne)

== Game Over ==
note over GR: Beregner tid og attempts\nGemmer i leaderboard\nHenter top 10

GR --> P: **game_over**\n{win: true, elapsed_secs: 45,\nlevels_reached: 2,\nleaderboard: [...]}
GR --> C: **game_over**\n(same)

note over P: GameOverScreen:\n"YOU WIN!"\nTime: 45s | Attempts: 2\nTop 10 leaderboard
note over C: Samme skaerm

@enduml
